#
# Fail-witness for ex:saActingGroupIsNeverDerived: a property chain that would give
# every action on a root system that root system's Weyl group as its actor, so an
# action of a subgroup would acquire the full Weyl group as a second actor.
@prefix math:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .

math:actingGroup logic:propertyChainAxiom ( math:actsOn math:weylGroup ) .
